  "notes": "Released as a research preview; the API model id was gpt-4.5-preview. Lifecycle and dates refer to the API: shut down on 2025-07-14 after the 2025-04-14 deprecation notice. The launch post said GPT-4.5 is more expensive than GPT-4o and not a replacement for it, and that OpenAI was evaluating whether to keep serving it in the API long-term. In ChatGPT, GPT-5 replaced it as a default model on 2025-08-07 (src.openai.gpt-5-announcement)."
